filter: return an error from apply_gabor_like when the padded color region is not inside the frame
buffer, instead of assert!(region.contains(color_padded_region)), and clamp the subgrid ranges.
Test: gabor_region_bounds (crates/jxl-oxide-tests/tests/gabor_region_bounds.rs).

Upstream: not reported; the code is unchanged at upstream HEAD (c0cc4c7, 2026-08-15).

